Most of the jellies and molds are good. Nagas and creatures that have 
some kind of elemental attack/name like red molds ("You are suddenly 
very hot") or Fire Giants. "You are what you eat", or near enough. Also 
unicorns (non co-aligned ones, since killing co-aligned unicorns is not 
such a good idea, afaik).

Black puddings are a good source of shock resistance, but somewhat hard 
to kill for low level characters and may damage your equipment.

Also giants are pretty strong, which can be useful when you eat their 
corpses...

Poisonous creatures (bees for example), will never insta-kill you when 
you eat their corpses and when you can get rid of/guard against the ill 
effects of the poison, they are quite a good source of poison 
resistance. (Like, having a unicorn horn or wearing a ring/amulet of 
poison resistance).

